# M8 (b1): characteristics across zones.
# A color chosen as a permanent enters, added in every zone (Painter's Servant).
category:CHOOSE_COLOR
row:add_color
# A characteristic-defining ability off the battlefield (Grist, Nethergoyf).
row:off_battlefield_face
# Reflexive sacrifice offered, and the repeat (Grist).
cost:SACRIFICE.unless
trigger:Reflexive
effect:Repeat
# Layer-6 grants and the scoped conversion (Agatha's Soul Cauldron).
row:gains_abilities_of
row:mana_convert_scoped
# Combat damage that can't be prevented (Frenzied Baloth).
row:cant_prevent_damage
